[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0010","text":"──差不多该上场了\n真乃，准备好了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0020","text":"……没问题，的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0030","text":"我会全力以赴的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0040","text":"哈哈，干劲十足啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0050","text":"……也许是这套服装的功劳"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0060","text":"穿上它\n就感觉充满了力量……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0070","text":"嗯──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0080","text":"今天的真乃一定能\n飞得很高"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0090","text":"————是的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_03_0100","text":"……高高地，漂亮地──\n飞过去……"}]
